  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UI are arranging &quot;Gymnasiedagarna&quot; (&quot;High school days&quot;) with readings about global issues eight times per year. They also film the readings which we help to spred on the web and in social media.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UI ordnar Gymnasiedagarna med f&#xf6;rel&#xe4;sningar om utrikespolitiska fr&#xe5;gor 8 g&#xe5;nger per &#xe5;r.Ut&#xf6;ver detta filmar UI f&#xf6;rel&#xe4;sningarna och Sida hj&#xe4;lps att sprida filmerna p&#xe5; webb och sociala medier.</narrative>
  </description>
